WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Type /error
Start with a focused search for error events.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Press H — count matches by hour
Exact counts across the indexed file; context is excluded.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.800
Scroll the hourly report
Read the dates, UTC hours, counts and distribution.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.000
Press Esc — return to the filtered log
Keep the error filter while changing the time interval.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Type histogram minute
Choose one-minute buckets from the command dialog.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.300
Press Page Down — explore minute buckets
Scroll through the finer-grained distribution.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.500
Press Esc — keep the filter, close the report
Return to the source events without rebuilding the query.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.700
Type x — remove last filter
Undo the search and restore every event.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.700
Browse the restored log
The original data remains unchanged throughout the investigation.
